  "description": "Macro for the match AI of every champion: three or more allies at an attackable enemy nexus (and more than its defenders) hit it instead of walking away; while our minions carry the baron buff (epic_minion_buff) and we are not down in numbers, the team pushes with a baron wave the way its tactic (Morgard buff usage) says: group as 5 with the wave nearest it; 1-4 split: the named player is left to the game AI on the far lane, the other four take the wave nearest them; 1-3-1 split: the two named players are left to the game AI on the side lanes, the other three take the mid wave. Only a Top or Jungle player splits: a Mid, Bottom or Support player named to split groups with the team (a 1-3-1 left with one side laner plays as 1-4, with none as group as 5). Fights and skills stay the game AI's and the hero add-ons'. Log: league_macro.log.\n\n比赛 AI 的运营：3 个以上我方英雄到了能打的对面基地（而且比守的人多）就打基地，不再走开；我方小兵带着大龙 buff、人数不吃亏时，按队伍战术里的「莫尔加德 buff 用法」推进：全员抱团就全队跟离本队最近的那波强化兵；1-4 分推时指定的那个选手交给游戏 AI 去带对面那一路，另外四个跟离他们最近的强化兵；1-3-1 分推时指定的两个选手交给游戏 AI 各带一路边线，另外三个跟中路的强化兵。只有上单、打野会去分推：被指派的中单、射手、辅助跟大部队（1-3-1 只剩一个上单 / 打野时按 1-4 打，一个都没有就全员抱团）。打架、放技能照旧是游戏 AI 和英雄附加包的。日志 league_macro.log。",
  "last_updated": "2026-11-08",
  "mod_id": "league_macro",
  "mod_type": "native",
  "name": "League Heroes: macro (finish the nexus, push with the baron waves)",
  "version": "0.1.5"
}